rst three standard, then 1D4+2 optional systems of choice); none is a fixed grant to every officer, so all of it is in GM Notes. Catalog rows that match items on those lists: multi-system-eye-socket, universal-headjack-and-ear-implant, cyberlink-vehicle-interfacing, gromeko-friend-or-foe-identification-computer, light-filters-cyber-optic, rvb-31-concealed-vibro-blade, chemical-spray, pl-31-palm-laser-torch, universal-finger-camera, tool-hand. || The Light Machine cyborg details are referred to the Cyborg O.C.C.s section and are not part of this draft."
